Akshay Kumar revealed that his social media screen time is around 15–20 minutes a day. He noticed that some people use social media for 5–6 hours, which often leads to neck pain. He suggests that they don’t spend too
much time on social media, and he follows the same rule for his daughter.

Nowadays, most people don’t play outdoors, which is a result of constant screen exposure. Doctors say that limiting screen time is not only important for mental well-being but also for physical health. Many of their 
patients complain about stiffness and spine pain, so reducing screen time can help ease these problems.. 
